      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers speak warmly of Dr. Oh, describing him as a kind, patient, and knowledgeable veterinarian who takes time to examine pets thoroughly. However, numerous clients express frustration regarding front desk personnel, reporting rude reception interactions, abrupt telephone conduct, and indifference toward arriving pet owners."
      }
    },
