      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Accessible and reasonable clinic rates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A key highlight for many pet owners is the clinic's affordability compared to higher-priced veterinary facilities across the Valley. Reviewers appreciate fair fees for exams, lab work, routine vaccinations, and feline dental cleanings, though one client noted that overall veterinary care costs can still add up quickly."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective treatments with mixed outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Several clients report successful medical outcomes, including effective medication plans for senior pets, thorough diagnostic lab work, and positive dental cleaning procedures for cats. Conversely, critical reviews describe unresolved illnesses and miscommunications surrounding serious chronic conditions such as canine diabetes."
      }
    }
  ],
